== Description ==

The '''Campfire''' is the entry-tier utility station: charcoal, glue, and early build components. It defines 5 raw recipe entries (5 unique after consolidating shape variants), producing outputs including [[Burning]], [[Charcoal]], [[Clay]], [[Glue]], [[WIP]].

== Technical ==

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.Campfire</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Campfire</code>.

